    summary: pair('把合同权利、平台权限、披露、广告设置、素材版本和撤销流程分别确认，避免把一个授权按钮当成完整许可。', 'Verify contractual rights, platform permissions, disclosure, ad setup, asset version and revocation separately.'),
    metaDescription: pair('合作广告权限检查：合同使用权、平台授权、披露、素材、受众、投放期限、数据和撤销。', 'Review partnership ads across contractual rights, platform authorization, disclosure, assets, audience, term, data and revocation.'),
    coverAlt: pair('一位亚裔男性创作者与一位黑人女性品牌制作人在真实工作室核对竖屏视频和授权文件', 'An Asian male creator and a Black female brand producer reviewing vertical video and permission documents in a real studio'),
    answer: pair('达人在平台内授权品牌放大内容，只解决技术访问的一部分。上线前仍要确认合同允许付费使用、具体素材和版本、平台与账号、地区、期限、预算、允许编辑、披露、评论管理、数据访问和撤销方式。平台权限与合同期限不一致时，以更窄的有效范围执行并修正记录。投放结束后验证广告停止、权限撤销和素材不再被新广告调用。', 'A platform permission from the creator solves only part of technical access. Before launch, confirm contractual paid use, exact asset and version, platform and handle, territory, term, budget, allowed edits, disclosure, comment handling, data access and revocation. If platform access and agreement differ, operate within the narrower valid scope and correct the record. After the campaign, verify ads stop, permission is revoked and the asset cannot enter new ads.'),
    sections: [
      [pair('先确认商业权利，再申请平台权限', 'Confirm commercial rights before platform access'), pair('合同应明确广告用途、地区、期限、素材和是否可修改。没有书面付费使用权时，不因为平台按钮可用就开始投放。\n\n保存签署版本和到期时间，并让媒体团队能够看到限制，而不是只由法务保管。', 'The agreement should define advertising use, territory, term, assets and editing. A working platform button does not authorize paid use without written rights.\n\nStore the signed version and expiry where media teams can see restrictions rather than leaving them only with legal.')],
      [pair('核对授权账号与内容版本', 'Verify account and asset version'), pair('确认达人主页、品牌广告账户、合作内容 ID、字幕、音乐和最终批准版本。错误账号或旧剪辑可能导致品牌与达人都无法控制的投放。\n\nMeta 的合作广告流程要求内容所有者允许商业合作伙伴推广，授权请求与广告创建是独立步骤。', 'Confirm creator profile, brand ad account, content ID, captions, music and final approved version. A wrong account or old cut can create activity neither party intended.\n\nMeta partnership-ad guidance separates creator permission from ad creation; both steps need verification.')],
      [pair('让披露与广告状态保持一致', 'Keep disclosure aligned with ad status'), pair('商业关系应在原内容和广告呈现中清楚可识别。Meta 将免费赠品也纳入可能的价值交换，并要求品牌内容使用 paid partnership 标签。\n\n不同市场仍需核对当地规则。平台标签不能替代所有法律披露，也不能修复错误产品声明。', 'The commercial relationship should remain clear in original content and the ad. Meta includes free gifted products as a possible exchange of value and requires the paid partnership label for branded content.\n\nLocal rules still apply. A platform label does not replace every legal disclosure or correct a false product claim.')],
      [pair('建立结束与撤销清单', 'Create an end-of-use checklist'), pair('记录广告结束、权限撤销、剩余排期、素材归档、数据快照和费用结算。若需要续投，先完成新的范围和价格确认。\n\nQuickKOL 中把广告权限、合同权利和素材状态作为三个字段。任何一个到期都应阻止新投放。', 'Record ad end, permission revocation, remaining schedules, asset archive, data snapshot and settlement. Confirm new scope and price before extension.\n\nKeep platform access, contractual rights and asset status as separate QuickKOL fields. Expiry of any one should block new spend.')],
    ],
